title: "Leakage-Aware Cross-Dataset Evaluation of GPU Workload Prediction: When Do Deep Sequence Models Actually Beat Simple Baselines?"
authors:
  - family-names: "Tripathi"
    given-names: "Apoorva"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24096961
repository-code: "https://github.com/apoorvatripathi071-tech/gpu-workload-prediction-benchmark"
abstract: "Benchmark code for a leakage-aware, cross-dataset study of GPU workload prediction on the Microsoft Philly and Alibaba PAI GPU v2020 production traces: harmonized machine-history preprocessing, CNN/LSTM/Hybrid models, naive/Ridge/XGBoost/ARIMA baselines, multi-seed confidence intervals, paired significance testing, and a leakage-safe target-history lag-feature experiment."
